{"id":"99f12f1125ed236a","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-map.md","title":"ZFC Recursion4 Computable Map","display":"df-zfc-recursion4-computable-map — ZFC Recursion4 Computable Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-map"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion4-computable-map — ZFC Recursion4 Computable Map","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-recursion4-name-in-computable-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion4-computable-map — ZFC Recursion4 Computable Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7f0d78eba77f4a30\" href=\"?note=7f0d78eba77f4a30\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cd77d1a968b64c37\" href=\"?note=cd77d1a968b64c37\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-recursion4-computable-metric-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aae13e7d5032f432\" href=\"?note=aae13e7d5032f432\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-recursion4-name-in-computable-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-recursion4-name-in-computable-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,d_X,\\alpha_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha_Y,f,e,\\Phi_e,x,p,q,G\\in V\">\\(X,d_X,\\alpha_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha_Y,f,e,\\Phi_e,x,p,q,G\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4NameInComputableSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4NameInComputableSpace}_S\\)</span> (space and name predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi_e,e)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi_e,e)\\)</span> (Turing-functional predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BaireGraphCode}_S(G,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{BaireGraphCode}_S(G,p)\\)</span> (natural-number graph-code predicate defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OracleOutput}_S(q,\\Phi,G)\">\\(\\mathrm{OracleOutput}_S(q,\\Phi,G)\\)</span> (total oracle-output predicate defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\)</span> (function predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMap}_S(X,d_X,\\alpha_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha_Y,f)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMap}_S(X,d_X,\\alpha_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha_Y,f)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}baire\\text{-}graph\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{BaireGraphCode}_S(G,p)\\leftrightarrow p\\in\\omega^\\omega\\land G=\\left\\{\\frac{(n+p(n))(n+p(n)+1)}2+p(n)\\mid n\\in\\omega\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}baire\\text{-}graph\\text{-}code} \\vdash \\mathrm{BaireGraphCode}_S(G,p)\\leftrightarrow p\\in\\omega^\\omega\\land G=\\left\\{\\frac{(n+p(n))(n+p(n)+1)}2+p(n)\\mid n\\in\\omega\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}output} \\vdash \\mathrm{OracleOutput}_S(q,\\Phi,G)\\leftrightarrow q\\in\\omega^\\omega\\land\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\langle\\langle G,n\\rangle,m\\rangle\\in\\Phi\\leftrightarrow q(n)=m\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}output} \\vdash \\mathrm{OracleOutput}_S(q,\\Phi,G)\\leftrightarrow q\\in\\omega^\\omega\\land\\forall n,m\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\langle\\langle G,n\\rangle,m\\rangle\\in\\Phi\\leftrightarrow q(n)=m\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}computable\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMap}_S(X,d_X,\\alpha_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha_Y,f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S(X,d_X,\\alpha_X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S(Y,d_Y,\\alpha_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\Phi_e\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi_e,e)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall p\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4NameInComputableSpace}_S(X,d_X,\\alpha_X,x,p)\\to\\exists G\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\exists q\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{BaireGraphCode}_S(G,p)\\land\\mathrm{OracleOutput}_S(q,\\Phi_e,G)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4NameInComputableSpace}_S(Y,d_Y,\\alpha_Y,f(x),q))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}computable\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMap}_S(X,d_X,\\alpha_X,Y,d_Y,\\alpha_Y,f)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S(X,d_X,\\alpha_X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4ComputableMetricSpace}_S(Y,d_Y,\\alpha_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\Phi_e\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2TuringFunctional}_S(\\Phi_e,e)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall p\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4NameInComputableSpace}_S(X,d_X,\\alpha_X,x,p)\\to\\exists G\\subseteq\\omega\\;\\exists q\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{BaireGraphCode}_S(G,p)\\land\\mathrm{OracleOutput}_S(q,\\Phi_e,G)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4NameInComputableSpace}_S(Y,d_Y,\\alpha_Y,f(x),q))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>One Turing functional transforms every valid name of every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span> into a valid name of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)\">\\(f(x)\\)</span>. Cantor pairing turns the name graph into an actual subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>, matching the oracle sort required by the upstream functional.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-recursion2-turing-functional.md","status":"resolved","id":"7f0d78eba77f4a30","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","locatio